(property "Description" "Commercial assembled hub external solder-pad interface; compound identifiers are PCB connector/contact names, not CH334F IC pins. | module | CRITICAL: JP pads2=D+,3=D−, opposite USB-A contacts2=D−,3=D+. H1=JP2,H2=JP1,H3=JP3,H4=JP4.; H2/H3/H4 pad1 is electrically LAB5 inside board but NO outgoing VBUS wire is fitted. H1 spare not populated. Existing onboard bypass/PTC/clock are part of assembled module.; JP5 5V externally fed from LAB5; its D+/D−/GND from Q6A J2 P3. USB-C upstream socket unused; never plug a second host. H1 USB fallback requires explicit cable build and firmware profile." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
