(text "Received Wisecoco board DC barrel size/polarity and USBTP/USB-C touch wiring still undocumented; no-VBUS\nenumeration must work.\nВорота (стенд): Obtain the exact board photo/schematic, DMM mapping, vendor confirmation and enumerate with\nonly D+/D−/GND. Never substitute guessed connector numbering." (at 306.07 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 52bde25b-7b05-52f8-8c5d-74fd03ac36b5))
