(text "HDMI/display/hub and receiver backfeed paths through signal lines need physical power-state validation.\nВорота (стенд): Verify Q6A off / LAB5 on / display on combinations using DMM/FNB58. Q6A HDMI 5 V and Q6A USB\nVBUS should remain 0 V within measurement resolution. Check DDC/HPD after U506 installation and no phantom\nreceiver power." (at 306.07 56.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3a81efda-5067-550b-adc8-d27e10b464aa))
