(text "VBUS RTL-A і LAB PORT" (at 304.8 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid 238fca94-35b8-5783-b6a1-e6c9d886b9e7))
(rectangle (start 304.8 198.12) (end 441.96 226.06) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 9c582006-cf78-5c35-b4c9-5ea1c64ab413))
(text "E5-04 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.1 (VBUS RTL-A, HF+); §8 (TPS2553DBVR-1 п. 2–3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 306.07 199.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid a3705d8e-ae20-5179-ae17-692bbd1659bc))
(text "Current-setting resistors R501 (RTL-A), R509 (HF+), R514 (T7) and R553 (IMU pack, U553) are engineering\nstarting values (RILIM TBD); STACK §5.1 fixes only the rule 1.5–2× measured current. No measured device\nsteady/startup currents or hot-corner proof.\nВорота (стенд): Measure current/inrush; set the RTL-A/HF+/T7 limits to 1.5–2× the measured current as STACK\n§5.1 requires; confirm HF+ minimum startup ≥0.75 A. Run the STACK §8 TPS2553DBVR-1 item 3 inrush test on\nlatching U503 (HF+ LC 100 µH/100 µF + 220 µF damper) at final RILIM; only if it latches, fit TPS2553DBVR\n(constant-current) on this channel alone. Retry/latch test at all battery states; scope LC overshoot. IMU pack\nbranch (R-E5-08): measure the pack supply current at the J504 lead (start-up and streaming) and set R553 to\n1.5-2x (start 88.7k, 265-339 mA); short the far end of the 2 m cable and confirm U553 limits without latching,\nrecovers after the short is removed and LAB5 does not droop below the E1-05 limits." (at 306.07 201.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 152a63be-0d84-583c-95cf-19a024e9773b))
(rectangle (start 304.8 228.6) (end 441.96 238.76) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 0 60 150 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 469321ea-aee0-50e9-b9c7-b3c91e60f2ba))
(text "N-E5-01 — примітка — STACK §5.1 (VBUS RTL-A); §8 (TPS2553DBVR-1 п. 2–3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 306.07 229.87 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 0 60 150 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4fe95be0-6098-5252-b5ed-bd8dab85bc42))
(text "R501 = RILIM TBD (старт 43.2k 1%, 0.544–0.673 A). STACK для VBUS RTL-A задає лише правило RILIM = 1.5–2×\nвиміряного струму; номінал STACK є тільки для порту LAB (R505 34.8k). Ворота: E5-04." (at 306.07 231.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 275f62a1-71e1-586f-8f07-a9bef6db9ebd))
